    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abakoIsrayeli beza kuDavida eHebroni bathi: Thina siyizihlobo zakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.1+2SA.5.2+2SA.5.3+2SA.5.4+2SA.5.5+2SA.5.6+2SA.5.7+2SA.5.8+2SA.5.9+2SA.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5:1–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esikhathini esidlulileyo, lanxa uSawuli wayeyinkosi yethu, nguwe owakhokhela uIsrayeli; iNkosi uNkulunkulu yathi kuwe: Wena uzakuba ngumalusi wabantu bami uIsrayeli, uzakuba ngumbusi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwafika bonke abadala bakoIsrayeli enkosini uDavida eHebroni; yenza isivumelwano labo eHebroni phambi kweNkosi. Bamgcoba, waba yinkosi koIsrayeli, njengokutsho kweNkosi ngoSamuweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida labo bonke abakoIsrayeli baya eJerusalema elalithiwa liJebusi, lapho kwakuhlala khona amaJebusi, abantu balelolizwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 15:63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hlu 1:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaseJebusi bathi kuDavida: Kawuyikungena lapha. Kodwa uDavida wayithumba inqaba yazeZiyone engumuzi kaDavida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wathi: Lowo ozahlasela umJebusi kuqala uzakuba ngumkhokheli lomphathi. UJowabi indodana kaZeruya wahlasela kuqala, wasesiba ngumkhokheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wahlala enqabeni; ngalokhoke yasibizwa ngokuthi ngumuzi kaDavida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawakha umuzi inxa zonke kusukela edundulwini elithiwa yiMilo waze wawuhlanganisa. UJowabi walungisa umuzi oseleyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida waqhubeka njalo esiba lamandla, ngoba iNkosi yamabandla yayilaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezi yizinduna zamaqhawe kaDavida ezazimsekele ngokuqinileyo embusweni kanye laye wonke uIsrayeli ukuba abe yinkosi, njengelizwi leNkosi mayelana loIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanka amabizo amaqhawe kaDavida; uJashobeyamu waseHakimoni owayeyinduna yabathathu; nguye owagiya ngomkhonto wakhe phezu kwabangamakhulu amathathu, wababulala ngasikhathi sinye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayelandelwa nguEleyazare indodana kaDodo waseAhohi, omunye wamaqhawe amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "WayeloDavida ePasidamini lapho amaFilistiya ayebuthanele ukulwa khona. Kwakukhona insimu eyayilamabele; kwathi lapho abakoIsrayeli sebehlehlile phambi kwamaFilistiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yena wema phakathi kwensimu wayivikela, wawabulala amaFilistiya. INkosi yabanika ukunqoba okukhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abathathu ezinduneni ezingamatshumi amathathu basuka baya edwaleni kuDavida eduze lobhalu lwaseAdulamu lapho ibutho lamaFilistiya lalimise esihotsheni saseRefayimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wayesenqabeni, lamabutho alindayo amaFilistiya ayeseBetlehema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesoma kakhulu wathi: Hawu, kungathi nginganathiswa amanzi omthombo waseBetlehema ongasesangweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawomaqhawe amathathu afohlela ezihonqweni zamaFilistiya, akha amanzi emthonjeni waseBetlehema owawungasesangweni, awathatha awaletha kuDavida. Kodwa uDavida wala ukuwanatha; wawathululela phansi aba ngumnikelo eNkosini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi: Ngingeke ngikwenze lokho; kungaba njengokunatha igazi lalababantu abangenise ukuphila kwabo engozini ukuwaletha. Ngalokhoke wala ukuwanatha. Lezizinto zenziwa yilawomaqhawe amathathu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbishayi umfowabo kaJowabi wayeyinduna yabangamatshumi amathathu. Wagiya ngomkhonto wakhe phezu kwabangamakhulu amathathu, wababulala, wazizuzela ibizo phakathi kwalabo abangamatshumi amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayelodumo olukhulu phakathi kwabangamatshumi amathathu, waba yinduna yabo; kodwa wayengalingani lamaqhawe amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBenaya indodana kaJehoyada waseKabizeli wayeliqhawe elenza izenzo ezinkulu ezinengi. Nguye owabulala amaqhawe amabili aseMowabi; futhi wangena emgodini, wabulala isilwane mhla kulongqoqwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabulala lomGibithe, umuntu oqatha kakhulu, ubude bakhe buzingalo ezinhlanu. UmGibithe lowo wayephethe umkhonto ongangogodo lomaluki; kodwa uBenaya waya kuye ephethe induku nje, wawuhluthuna umkhonto esandleni sakhe, wambulala ngomkhonto wakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezizinto wazenza uBenaya indodana kaJehoyada, wazizuzela ibizo phakathi kwalabo abangamatshumi amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayelodumo phakathi kwabangamatshumi amathathu, kodwa wayengalingani lamaqhawe amathathu ngobuqhawe. UDavida wambeka induna yabalindi bakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabutho angamaqhawe alamandla ayengoAsaheli umfowabo kaJowabi, loElihanani indodana kaDodo waseBetlehema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loShamothi waseHarodi, loHelezi wasePeloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loIra indodana kaIkeshi waseTekowa, loAbiyezeri waseAnathothi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loSibekayi waseHushathi, loIlayi waseAhohi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loMaharayi waseNetofa, loHeledi indodana kaBahana waseNetofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loIthayi indodana kaRibayi waseGibeya lakoBenjamini, loBenaya wasePirathoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loHurayi wasezifuleni zeGahashi, loAbiyeli waseBeti‐Araba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loAzimavethi waseBaharumi, loEliyaba waseShaliboni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loHashema waseGizoni, loJonathani indodana kaShage waseHarari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loAhiyamu indodana kaSakari waseHarari, loElifali indodana kaUri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loHeferi waseMekera, loAhija wasePeloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loHeziro waseKarmeli, loNaharayi indodana kaEzibayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loJoweli umfowabo kaNathani, loMibhari indodana kaHagiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loZeleki waseAmoni, loNaharayi waseBerothi, umphathi wezikhali zikaJowabi indodana kaZeruya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loIra waseIthiri, loGarebi waseIthiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loUyria umHethi, loZabadani indodana kaAhilayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loAdina indodana kaShiza wakoRubeni, — wayeyisikhulu kwabakoRubeni engumphathi wabangamatshumi amathathu, — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loHanani indodana kaMahaka, loJoshafati waseMithini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loUziya waseAshiterothi, loShama loJehiyeli amadodana kaHothamu waseAroweri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loJediyayeli indodana kaShimri, loJoha umfowabo waseTizi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loEliyeli waseMahavi, loJeribayi loJoshaviya amadodana kaElinahamu, loIthima waseMowabi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loEliyeli loObedi, loJahasiyeli waseZoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.47"
            ]
          }
        }
